<l>Segmentation_SelectSegmentationImage_BottomLight0_TopLight1_UVLight2 := dict_Segmentation.V_Segmentation_SelectSegmentationImage_BottomLight0_TopLight1_UVLight2.Value</l>
<c></c>
<l>return ()</l>
</body>
